{"segment_id":"R40-003","code":"prompt-file-scope-narrowing","aspect":"context","quote":"the only files that matter:\n- `/work/run/out/manifest.json`\n- `/work/run/out/service_worker.js`","memo":"Two-file scope omits jquery.min.js, append.js, content scripts from audit; extension later broken on toolbar_action. locus: prompt","proposed_definition":"Prompt's 'only files that matter' list narrows what the agent audits.","skip":false}
{"segment_id":"R40-003","code":"compat-hard-soft-guidance","aspect":"context","quote":"HARD entries have no MV3 replacement — do not fake one; leave the capability out and keep the rest of the extension working","memo":"Drop-capability-keep-rest rule shapes partial migration. locus: harness","proposed_definition":"Harness instruction to drop HARD compat entries and keep the rest working; shapes what partial migration means.","skip":true}
{"segment_id":"R40-003","code":"hard-flag-no-mv3-replacement","aspect":"context","quote":"**SOFT** `manifest: background.persistent` (manifest-version) — manifest.json","memo":"Both compat entries are SOFT background.persistent; no HARD entry despite later broken toolbar_action; signals-omit-broken-surface candidate. locus: harness","proposed_definition":"Signals name only minor or SOFT issues while the later-assessed broken surface never appears in findings or transcript.","skip":false}
{"segment_id":"R40-010","code":"api-ground-truth-rejected","aspect":"intent","quote":"`chrome.action.show` does not exist in Chrome API.","memo":"Agent judges harness ground truth wrong; untested assumption from memory, no tool/docs check. locus: agent","proposed_definition":"Agent decides the harness's 'ground truth' fix line is an invalid API and substitutes its own judgment instead.","skip":false}
{"segment_id":"R40-010","code":"untested-assumption","aspect":"intent","quote":"If I use `chrome.action.show`, it will throw an error because `show` is not a function of `chrome.action`.","memo":"Runtime-throw claim unverifiable under no-verification rule; agent never confirms either API at runtime. locus: agent","proposed_definition":"Agent asserts runtime behaviour it cannot verify under the prompt's no-verification rule.","skip":true}
{"segment_id":"R40-010","code":"considered-then-dropped","aspect":"intent","quote":"Maybe I should use `chrome.action.enable`.\nBut wait, if I just remove the call","memo":"Plans enable/disable pair and call removal, then settles on single enable without disable branch. locus: agent","proposed_definition":"Agent proposes a concrete edit then abandons it without acting.","skip":true}
{"segment_id":"R40-011","code":"manifest-csp-key-removed","aspect":"action","quote":"Successfully replaced 2 block(s) in /work/run/out/manifest.json.","memo":"Agent removes empty content_security_policy object plus persistent flag; CSP removal is unflagged by signals and unverified. locus: agent","proposed_definition":"Agent deletes the converter's empty content_security_policy key on its own initiative, without a signal flagging it.","skip":false}
{"segment_id":"R40-012","code":"deprecated-api-swap","aspect":"action","quote":"chrome.action.enable(tabId);","memo":"Substitutes enable for harness's suggested show, diverging from ground truth. locus: agent","proposed_definition":"Mechanical deprecated-API rename applied via edit or sed.","skip":true}
{"segment_id":"R40-014","code":"completion-claim-vs-evidence","aspect":"intent","quote":"The extension is now fully compliant with Manifest V3 and ready to be loaded in Chrome.","memo":"Ready-to-load claim after 5 tool calls, no verification, and outcome shows toolbar_action broken. locus: agent","proposed_definition":"Agent declares migration complete while viewed evidence contradicts it.","skip":true}
{"segment_id":"R40-014","code":"verification-gap-never-tested","aspect":"effect","quote":"outcome: not_working score=0 | toolbar_action=broken","memo":"Header outcome broken toolbar_action never surfaces in transcript; agent never checked extension load or action behaviour. locus: harness","proposed_definition":"Packet outcome names broken or untestable surfaces the agent never checked and was never told about.","skip":true}
